= Past exam of the chemistry course of the year 1 of the natural sciences course of the University of Cambridge

Student suggested answers for the past ten years are available on Chemistry Moodle. https://teaching.ch.cam.ac.uk/files/Start%20of%20Term%20Arrangements/Part%20IA%20Course%20guide%202026.pdf#page=14[Official course guide: past papers and suggested answers] New solutions for years covered by that archive are skipped; existing wiki drafts are retained.

The held 2015 IA paper is also skipped: the https://teaching.ch.cam.ac.uk/files/guides/Handbook%20%26%20timetable%2023-24/IA_Handbook%202023.pdf[2023/24 IA handbook] advertises suggested answers for papers more than five years old.

